      "confidence": 0.95,
      "evidence": [
        "ae_ip_by_year.csv: abrupt drop from 2018 (0.81) to 2019 (0.24) forming a flat-bottomed trough through 2020",
        "evidence pack: excursion 2019-2020 score 11.1, onset 0.99 (entire level change arrives in one year, no gradual build-up)",
        "cross-line block: large YoY swings isolated to IP, confirming line-specific event rather than book-wide coordinated movement"
      ],
      "recommended_action": "Investigate operational or data causes for the 2019-2020 IP claims trough (e.g., claims reporting lag, eligibility/policy changes, system migration, or book discontinuation). Verify data integrity for those years. Assess whether the post-2021 level (~1.25 vs ~1.20 pre-drop) reflects a new structural baseline requiring pricing/valuation updates, or is a delayed catch-up effect."
    }
  ]
}

